    "messageData": {
     "linkMetadata": null,
     "text": "On Slack/Teams, how do you feel about people who send a \"hello\" and wait for you to respond before posing the rest of their question? I can't stand it. I'm busy and don't have time to be doing the whole 'I'm good, you' thing every time someone needs something from me. Stating what you need to state right away is not rude."
